{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50360","headline":"敦煌廿咏（并序） 十三、墨池咏 · 敦煌人作品[一]","name":"敦煌廿咏（并序） 十三、墨池咏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔人精篆素，尽妙许张芝。\n草圣雄千古，芳名冠一时。\n舒笺行鸟迹，研墨染鱼缁。\n长想临池处，兴来聊咏诗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"敦煌人作品[一]","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50360.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50360","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}